// # assets/ — Static Binary Assets
//
// Logline: Browser-loadable binary files referenced from the HTML
//          shell and from social card scrapers.
//
// Beats:
//   1. favicon.svg   — the browser tab icon (24-line SVG, 281 bytes).
//   2. open-graph.png — the 1200x630 social card used by OpenGraph
//      and Twitter crawlers when a link is shared.
//
// No build step. Hand-maintained. Replace by overwriting the file.
